214		AIR FILTERS METAL BOWL	FILTERS, REGULATORS & LUBRICATORS	Fluid_Handling_mini_min_2	52	vision_pipeline/data/Fluid_Handling_mini_min_2/chunks/0214_air_filters_metal_bowl.md	# AIR FILTERS METAL BOWL\n\n**Category:** FILTERS, REGULATORS & LUBRICATORS\n**Source Page:** 52\n\n## Description\n\nFilters are used to separate dust, dirt, moisture & other contaminants from compressed air.\n\n## Features\n\n- Aluminium die-cast filter head & bowl\n- Includes 40 microns sintered bronze filter element\n- Press type semi-automatic drain that automatically drains out the bowl once compressed air supply is switched off\n- Factory Tested: 100%\n\n## Utility\n\n- Suitable for use in chemical plants, foundries etc where ambient air may contain chemicals such as acetone, benzene, kerosene, ethylene dichloride etc.\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **standard:** ISO 5782-1\n- **pressure:** 290 PSI (20 BAR)\n\n## Variants\n\n### F13-M\n\n**Miniature**\n\n#### Specifications\n\n- **thread:** Port Size: 1/8" & 1/4"\n- **flow_rate:** 800 LPM (28 CFM)\n\n---\n\n### F14-M\n\n**Intermediate**\n\n#### Specifications\n\n- **thread:** Port Size: 1/4" & 3/8"\n- **flow_rate:** 2,250 LPM (80 CFM)\n\n---\n\n### F15-M\n\n**Standard**\n\n#### Specifications\n\n- **thread:** Port Size: 1/2"\n- **flow_rate:** 3,500 LPM (125 CFM)\n\n---\n\n### F17-M\n\n**Heavy Duty**\n\n#### Specifications\n\n- **thread:** Port Size: 3/4" & 1"\n- **flow_rate:** 6,500 LPM (230 CFM)\n\n---\n	{"Utility": "- Suitable for use in chemical plants, foundries etc where ambient air may contain chemicals such as acetone, benzene, kerosene, ethylene dichloride etc.", "Features": "- Aluminium die-cast filter head & bowl\\n- Includes 40 microns sintered bronze filter element\\n- Press type semi-automatic drain that automatically drains out the bowl once compressed air supply is switched off\\n- Factory Tested: 100%", "Variants": "### F13-M\\n\\n**Miniature**\\n\\n#### Specifications\\n\\n- **thread:** Port Size: 1/8\\" & 1/4\\"\\n- **flow_