301	JC	Jenny Caliper Hermaphrodite Caliper	Jenny Caliper Hermaphrodite Caliper	Precision_Catalogue_CA_03	9	vision_pipeline/data/Precision_Catalogue_CA_03/chunks/0005_jc.md	# Jenny Caliper Hermaphrodite Caliper\n\n**Product Code:** `JC`\n**Category:** Jenny Caliper Hermaphrodite Caliper\n**Source Page:** 9\n\n## Description\n\nLeg that holds the adjustable point is offset. Locating lug is incorporated in the straight leg. Very useful in layout work for locating and testing centres, laying off distances from an edge etc. Jenny Caliper allows easy marking of arcs along the edge of workpiece.\n\n## Features\n\n- Lug provides additional support to the leg\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **hardness:** 54-62 HRC (Tip)\n\n## Variants\n\n### JC/6\n\n**6 inch / 150 mm Jenny Caliper**\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Size | Weight | Box_Qty | EAN | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| JC/6 | 01540 | 6 (INCH) / 150 (MM) | None | 200 | None | None |\n\n---\n	{"Features": "- Lug provides additional support to the leg", "Variants": "### JC/6\\n\\n**6 inch / 150 mm Jenny Caliper**\\n\\n#### Ordering Information\\n\\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Size | Weight | Box_Qty | EAN | Price |\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\\n| JC/6 | 01540 | 6 (INCH) / 150 (MM) | None | 200 | None | None |\\n\\n---", "Description": "Leg that holds the adjustable point is offset. Locating lug is incorporated in the straight leg. Very useful in layout work for locating and testing centres, laying off distances from an edge etc. Jenny Caliper allows easy marking of arcs along the edge of workpiece.", "Specifications": "- **hardness:** 54-62 HRC (Tip)"}	2026-06-19 09:47:55.265262
302		Spring Calipers & Dividers	05 Spring Calipers & Dividers	Precision_Catalogue_CA_03	10	vision_pipeline/data/Precision_Catalogue_CA_03/chunks/0006_spring_calipers_dividers.md	# Spring Calipers & Dividers\n\n**Category:** 05 Spring Calipers & Dividers\n**Source Page:** 10\n\n## Description\n\nCalipers are one of the oldest type of comparative measuring tools. Designed for taking comparative measurements and transferring the dimensions to a micrometer, precision rule etc. Dividers are used for marking out circles on steel or transferring measurement from master templates. Manufactured from selected steel, calipers and dividers have a spring joint for precision settings. Legs pivot on a roller and are tensioned by bow spring. The fulcrum stud with a large bearing surface that prevents side deflection of legs. Adjustment is made by opening and closing of the legs by means of an adjusting nut.\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **hardness:** 50-55 HRC\n\n## Variants\n\n### ID/3\n\n**Inside Caliper 3 inch**\n\nUsed to measure the internal diameter of a cylinder.\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Size | Weight | Box_Qty | EAN | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ID/3 | 01400 | 3" (75mm) | None | 200 | None | None |\n\n---\n\n### ID/4\n\n**Inside Caliper 4 inch**\n\nUsed to measure the internal diameter of a cylinder.\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Size | Weight | Box_Qty | EAN | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ID/4 | 01401 | 4" (100mm) | None | 200 | None | None |\n\n---\n\n### ID/6\n\n**Inside Caliper 6 inch**\n\nUsed to measure the internal diameter of a cylinder.\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Size | Weight | Box_Qty | EAN | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ID/6 | 01402 | 6" (150mm) | None | 100 | None | None |\n\n---\n\n### ID/8\n\n**Inside Caliper 8 inch**\n\nUsed to measure the internal diameter of a cylinder.\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat