314	MMED/1	Digital Outside Micrometers	Digital Outside Micrometers	Precision_Catalogue_CA_03	18	vision_pipeline/data/Precision_Catalogue_CA_03/chunks/0018_mmed1.md	# Digital Outside Micrometers\n\n**Product Code:** `MMED/1`\n**Category:** Digital Outside Micrometers\n**Source Page:** 18\n\n## Description\n\nSuperior tool designed to measure, record & display dimensions. It features a dual mode measurement system for inches and millimeters. The balanced steel frame prevents flexing, ensuring greater accuracy, and insulation at the top and bottom safeguards against data distortion from thermal expansion. It has an extra large, high contrast LCD digital read out. Non-wearing carbide tipped anvil and measuring faces ensure accurate measurements over a long period. The tool allows zero setting at any position along the scale. It includes a standard ball attachment to convert it into a pipe micrometer for measuring pipes and tubes. Supplied with master on all sizes except 0-25 mm / 0-1". It has an integral data output interface for PC/Laptop transfer (data cable not included) and comes complete with an SR44 battery.\n\n## Features\n\n- Superior tool designed to measure, record & display dimensions\n- Dual mode measurement system - inches & mm\n- Balanced Frame Design: Steel frame prevents flexing ensuring greater accuracy in measurement\n- Insulation at top and bottom end of the frame safeguards against data distortion due to thermal expansion\n- Extra large, high contrast LCD digital read out\n- Non – wearing carbide tipped anvil & measuring faces ensure accurate measurements over a long period of time\n- Zero setting at any position along the scale\n- Two Measuring Modes: Absolute and Incremental\n- Integral data output interface to transfer data to PC / Laptop etc.\n- Friction Thimble\n\n## Utility\n\n- Ball Attachment: Converts to a pipe micrometer for measuring pipes, tubes, etc.\n\n## Specifications\n\n| Specification | Value |\n| --- | --- |\n| **battery** | SR44 |\n| **ip_rating** | IP54 |\n| **other** | Anvil Ø 6.5 mm; Resolution: 0.00005" / 0.001 MM; Range: 0-25mm / 0-1" |\n\n## Variants\n\n### MMED/1\n\n**Digital Outside Micrometer**\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\nData cable not included; Supplied with master on all sizes except 0-25 mm / 0-1"\n	{"Notes": "Data cable not included; Supplied with master on all sizes except 0-25 mm / 0-1\\"", "Utility": "- Ball Attachment: Converts to a pipe micrometer for measuring pipes, tubes, etc.", "Features": "- Superior tool designed to measure, record & display dimensions\\n- Dual mode measurement system - inches & mm\\n- Balanced Frame Design: Steel frame prevents flexing ensuring greater accuracy in measurement\\n- Insulation at top and bottom end of the frame safeguards against data distortion due to thermal expansion\\n- Extra large, high contrast LCD digital read out\\n- Non – wearing carbide tipped anvil & measuring faces ensure accurate measurements over a long period of time\\n- Zero setting at any position along the scale\\n- Two Measuring Modes: Absolute and Incremental\\n- Integral data output interface to transfer data to PC / Laptop etc.\\n- Friction Thimble", "Variants": "### MMED/1\\n\\n**Digital Outside Micrometer**\\n\\n---", "Description": "Superior tool designed to measure, record & display dimensions. It features a dual mode measurement system for inches and millimeters. The balanced steel frame prevents flexing, ensuring greater accuracy, and insulation at the top and bottom safeguards against data distortion from thermal expansion. It has an extra large, high contrast LCD digital read out. Non-wearing carbide tipped anvil and measuring faces ensure accurate measurements over a long period. The tool allows zero setting at any position along the scale. It includes a standard ball attachment to convert it into a pipe micrometer for measuring pipes and tubes. Supplied with master on all sizes except 0-25 mm / 0-1\\". It has an integral data output interface for PC/Laptop tra