324	DDG	Digital Depth Gauges	25 Digital Depth Gauges	Precision_Catalogue_CA_03	26	vision_pipeline/data/Precision_Catalogue_CA_03/chunks/0028_ddg.md	# Digital Depth Gauges\n\n**Product Code:** `DDG`\n**Category:** 25 Digital Depth Gauges\n**Source Page:** 26\n\n## Description\n\nDesigned for measuring depths of holes, slots and recesses during inspection of jigs, fixtures and die work. This digital depth gauge features a dual mode measurement system for both inches and millimeters. It incorporates a free wheeling thumb roller mechanism for smooth movement along the linear scale and a convenient locking screw to set the caliper at any desired position, making it useful in applications requiring repetitive measurements. Measurement can be zero set at any position along the scale for incremental measurement. It boasts a large high contrast LCD digital readout and an integral data output interface to transfer data to PC/ Laptop (Data Cable not included).\n\n## Features\n\n- Measures depths of holes, slots, and recesses\n- Dual mode measurement system (inches & mm)\n- Free wheeling thumb roller mechanism for smooth movement\n- Convenient locking screw for setting caliper at desired position\n- Zero set at any position for incremental measurement\n- Large high contrast LCD digital readout\n- Integral data output interface (Data Cable not included)\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **other:** Resolution: 0.0005" / 0.01 MM\n\n## Variants\n\n### DDG/6\n\n**6 inch / 150 mm Digital Depth Gauge**\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Range_Inch | Range_MM | Accuracy_Inch | Accuracy_MM | A_Inch | A_MM | B_Inch | B_MM | L_Inch | L_MM | Box_Qty |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| DDG/6 | 16090 | 6 | 150 | ±0.001 | ±0.02 | 0.24 | 6.00 | 4 | 100.00 | 9.06 | 230.00 | 25 |\n\n---\n\n### DDG/8\n\n**8 inch / 200 mm Digital Depth Gauge**\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Range_Inch | Range_MM | Accuracy_Inch | Accur