326	CSQ	Combination Square Set	Combination Square Set	Precision_Catalogue_CA_03	28	vision_pipeline/data/Precision_Catalogue_CA_03/chunks/0030_csq.md	# Combination Square Set\n\n**Product Code:** `CSQ`\n**Category:** Combination Square Set\n**Source Page:** 28\n\n## Description\n\nAn exceptional set which combines several tools: Try squares, miter, depth gauge, height gauge, marking gauge, level & a precision rule.\n\n## Features\n\n- Highly versatile layout tool for scribing right angles & parallel lines (Square Head)\n- Precisely ground 90° square face & a 45° miter face (Square Head)\n- Used as a measuring tool that can work as a try square, miter, depth gauge, height gauge & a level (Square Head)\n- Used for accurately locating center of a cylindrical or square work piece (Center Head)\n- Includes revolving turrets with direct reading double graduations from 0 to 180° in opposite directions (Protractor Head)\n- Permits accurate & quick direct reading of angles above or below the blade (Protractor Head)\n- Precision Steel Rule with shoulder on one side\n- Steel Rule graduated with 0.50 mm & 32nds on one side & 1.0 mm & 64ths on the reverse side\n\n## Specifications\n\n\n\n## Variants\n\n### CSQ/12/4/ST\n\n**4 pc Combination Square**\n\n#### Specifications\n\n- **other:** Rule dimensions: 12" (300 mm) long x 1" (25 mm) wide x 2 mm thick\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Size | Weight | Box_Qty | EAN | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| CSQ/12/4/ST | 01070 | None | None | 10 | None | None |\n\n---\n	{"Features": "- Highly versatile layout tool for scribing right angles & parallel lines (Square Head)\\n- Precisely ground 90° square face & a 45° miter face (Square Head)\\n- Used as a measuring tool that can work as a try square, miter, depth gauge, height gauge & a level (Square Head)\\n- Used for accurately locating center of a cylindrical or square work piece (Center Head)\\n- Includes revolving turrets with direct reading doub