327	CG	Center Gauges	Center Gauges	Precision_Catalogue_CA_03	29	vision_pipeline/data/Precision_Catalogue_CA_03/chunks/0031_cg.md	# Center Gauges\n\n**Product Code:** `CG`\n**Category:** Center Gauges\n**Source Page:** 29\n\n## Description\n\nVery useful for grinding and setting thread cutting tools, checking the pitch of threads through the permanently deep etched graduations in 14ths, 20ths, 24ths and 32nds of an inch. These gauges meet the American National or US 60°, Whitworth or English 55° specifications.\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **standard:** American National or US 60°, Whitworth or English 55°\n\n## Variants\n\n### CG/55\n\n**55° Whitworth (English Standard)**\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Type | Box_Qty |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| CG/55 | 01210 | 55° Whitworth (English Standard) | 200 |\n\n---\n\n### CG/60\n\n**60° American National (US Standard)**\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Type | Box_Qty |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| CG/60 | 01211 | 60° American National (US Standard) | 200 |\n\n---\n	{"Variants": "### CG/55\\n\\n**55° Whitworth (English Standard)**\\n\\n#### Ordering Information\\n\\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Type | Box_Qty |\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\\n| CG/55 | 01210 | 55° Whitworth (English Standard) | 200 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n### CG/60\\n\\n**60° American National (US Standard)**\\n\\n#### Ordering Information\\n\\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Type | Box_Qty |\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\\n| CG/60 | 01211 | 60° American National (US Standard) | 200 |\\n\\n---", "Description": "Very useful for grinding and setting thread cutting tools, checking the pitch of threads through the permanently deep etched graduations in 14ths, 20ths, 24ths and 32nds of an inch. These gauges meet the American National or US 60°, Whitworth or English 55° specifications.", "Specifications": "- **standard:** American National or US 60°, Whitworth or English 55°"}	2026-06-19 09:48:04.030659
328	EF-EC	Electronic Edge Finder	Electronic Edge Finder	Precision_Catalogue_CA_03	29	vision_pipeline/data/Precision_Catalogue_CA_03/chunks/0032_ef_ec.md	# Electronic Edge Finder\n\n**Product Code:** `EF-EC`\n**Category:** Electronic Edge Finder\n**Source Page:** 29\n\n## Description\n\nElectronic Edge Finder is an easy, accurate & time saving tool for precisely locating work edges, shoulders, grooves etc. for use both on conventional & CNC machines.\n\n## Features\n\n- Designed with 6 equally spaced light ports for visibility from any angle\n- Edge finder lights instantly when the stylus touches the work edge\n- Reads off any electrically conductive metal\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **battery:** 12V battery\n- **other:** Concentricity: ± 0.0005°\n\n## Variants\n\n### EF/EC-1/-2/0.2\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Shank_Dia_Inch | Cylindrical_Head_Dia_Inch | Box_Qty |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| EF/EC-1/-2/0.2 | 03540 | 1/2 | 0.20 | 200 |\n\n---\n	{"Features": "- Designed with 6 equally spaced light ports for visibility from any angle\\n- Edge finder lights instantly when the stylus touches the work edge\\n- Reads off any electrically conductive metal", "Variants": "### EF/EC-1/-2/0.2\\n\\n#### Ordering Information\\n\\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Shank_Dia_Inch | Cylindrical_Head_Dia_Inch | Box_Qty |\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\\n| EF/EC-1/-2/0.2 | 03540 | 1/2 | 0.20 | 200 |\\n\\n---", "Description": "Electronic Edge Finder is an easy, accurate & time saving tool for precisely locating work edges, shoulders, grooves etc. for use both on conventional & CNC machines.", "Specifications": "- **battery:** 12V battery\\n- **other:** Concentricity: ± 0.0005°"}	2026-06-19 09:48:04.363989
329		Electronic & Audible Edge Finders	Electronic & Audible Edge Finders	Precision_Catalogue_CA_03	30	vision_pipeline/data/Precision_Catalogue_CA_03/chunks/0033_electronic_audible_edge_finders.md	# Electronic & Audible Edge Finders\n\n**Category:** Electronic & Audible Edge Finders\n**Source Page:** 30\n\n## Description\n\nEdge finders are designed for 2D aligning of component reference surfaces & edges, determining bore centres with reference to the centre of the machine spindles etc. Robust & non wearing design, with the body made from hardened steel & a spring loaded highly accurate steel ball. On contact between the spherical tip the metal component, the unit lights up, thus identifying the point of reference. All functional parts are hardened & accurately ground. Reads off any electrically conductive metal. Comes complete with batteries (12V Pencil).\n\n## Specifications\n\n| Specification | Value |\n| --- | --- |\n| **voltage** | 12V |\n| **battery** | Pencil |\n| **other** | Concentricity: ± 0.0004" | ± 0.010 MM |\n\n## Variants\n\n### EF/2D/1-2/0.2\n\n**Electronic**\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Type | Shank_Dia_(Inch) | Ball_Dia_(Inch) | Box_Qty |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| EF/2D/1-2/0.2 | 03538 | Electronic | 1/2 | 0.200 | 100 |\n\n---\n\n### EF/2D/I\n\n**Electronic**\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Type | Shank_Dia_(Inch) | Ball_Dia_(Inch) | Box_Qty |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| EF/2D/I | 03535 | Electronic | 3/4 | 0.400 | 100 |\n\n---\n\n### EF/2D/AD/I\n\n**Electronic & Audible**\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Type | Shank_Dia_(Inch) | Ball_Dia_(Inch) | Box_Qty |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| EF/2D/AD/I | 03537 | Electronic & Audible | 3/4 | 0.400 | 100 |\n\n---\n	{"Variants": "### EF/2D/1-2/0.2\\n\\n**Electronic**\\n\\n#### Ordering Information\\n\\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Type | Shank_Dia_(Inch) | Ball_Dia_(Inch) | Box_Qty |\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | -