338	HOG	Electronic Height Offset Gauge	Electronic Height Offset Gauge	Precision_Catalogue_CA_03	34	vision_pipeline/data/Precision_Catalogue_CA_03/chunks/0042_hog.md	# Electronic Height Offset Gauge\n\n**Product Code:** `HOG`\n**Category:** Electronic Height Offset Gauge\n**Source Page:** 34\n\n## Description\n\nConvenient & accurate tool to gauge the height offset of work piece from cutting tool.\n\n## Features\n\n- Gauge lights up instantly when the cutting tool touches the probe on the gauge resting on the work piece\n- 4 equally spaced light ports for visibility from any angle\n- Hardened and precision ground body.\n- Spring loaded probe safeguards against damage from overrun\n- Reads off any electrically conductive metal\n- Suitable for use both on conventional and CNC equipment\n- Furnished with bulb, 2 numbers of 1.5V button cells and protective case\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **battery:** 2 x 1.5V button cells\n- **other:** Gauge Height: WITHIN ± 0.0002" / ± 0.005 MM; Body Nominal Dia: 1" / 25.4 MM; Probe Nominal Dia: 7.990 – 8.01 MM (5/16" / 8 MM)\n\n## Variants\n\n### HOG/2\n\n**Electronic Height Offset Gauge**\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Size | Weight | Box_Qty | EAN | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| HOG/2 | 03560 | None | None | 100 | None | None |\n\n---\n	{"Features": "- Gauge lights up instantly when the cutting tool touches the probe on the gauge resting on the work piece\\n- 4 equally spaced light ports for visibility from any angle\\n- Hardened and precision ground body.\\n- Spring loaded probe safeguards against damage from overrun\\n- Reads off any electrically conductive metal\\n- Suitable for use both on conventional and CNC equipment\\n- Furnished with bulb, 2 numbers of 1.5V button cells and protective case", "Variants": "### HOG/2\\n\\n**Electronic Height Offset Gauge**\\n\\n#### Ordering Information\\n\\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Size | Weight | Box_Qty | EAN | Price |\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- 