339	34	Magnetic Compass	MBP	Precision_Catalogue_CA_03	35	vision_pipeline/data/Precision_Catalogue_CA_03/chunks/0043_34.md	# Magnetic Compass\n\n**Product Code:** `34`\n**Category:** MBP\n**Source Page:** 35\n\n## Description\n\nAn Angle Finder, Center Locator & Levelling Gauge - all in one\nDesigned to give full 360° readings via an accurate and balanced needle\nProtractor body is encased in cast aluminium shell with legs made from cast iron\nVee bases have inbuilt magnets that exert magnetic pull both within the Vee & across the bottom surface of the legs of the Vee. This allows the tool to attach instantly to any ferrous surface\nBases are precision ground and the center pin shows the middle point for locating centers on round objects\n\n## Features\n\n- Magnets fitted into the Vee bases\n- Center Locator Pin\n- Cast Aluminium Shell\n\n## Utility\n\n- Angle Finder\n- Center Locator\n- Levelling Gauge\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **other:** Angular Accuracy: ± 30'\n\n## Variants\n\n### MBP/01\n\n**Magnetic Compass**\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Size | Weight | Box_Qty | EAN | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| MBP/01 | 01690 | 5-5/16 (INCH) / 133 (MM) | None | 20 | None | None |\n\n---\n	{"Utility": "- Angle Finder\\n- Center Locator\\n- Levelling Gauge", "Features": "- Magnets fitted into the Vee bases\\n- Center Locator Pin\\n- Cast Aluminium Shell", "Variants": "### MBP/01\\n\\n**Magnetic Compass**\\n\\n#### Ordering Information\\n\\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Size | Weight | Box_Qty | EAN | Price |\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\\n| MBP/01 | 01690 | 5-5/16 (INCH) / 133 (MM) | None | 20 | None | None |\\n\\n---", "Description": "An Angle Finder, Center Locator & Levelling Gauge - all in one\\nDesigned to give full 360° readings via an accurate and balanced needle\\nProtractor body is encased in cast aluminium shell with legs made from cast iron\\nVee bases have inbuilt magnets that exert magnetic pull both within 