341		Dial Comparator Stands	Dial Comparator Stands	Precision_Catalogue_CA_03	37	vision_pipeline/data/Precision_Catalogue_CA_03/chunks/0045_dial_comparator_stands.md	# Dial Comparator Stands\n\n**Category:** Dial Comparator Stands\n**Source Page:** 37\n\n## Description\n\nComparator Stands are useful for fast and efficient dimensional inspection on production parts. The stand comprises of a sturdy cast iron base precisely ground and machined, providing a totally flat surface. The anvil is hardened to 55-58 HRC for greater wear resistance and lapped for high accuracy setting of jobs. The longitudinal slide can be adjusted to different positions using the knurled knob, moving along the ground steel pillar at accurate right angles to the base. It features a fine adjustment for accurate setting of jobs and includes a 6 mm holder for secure holding of dial gauges.\n\n## Features\n\n- Fast and efficient dimensional inspection\n- Sturdy cast iron base, precisely ground and machined for a totally flat surface\n- Anvil hardened to 55-58 HRC for wear resistance\n- Lapped anvil for high accuracy setting\n- Adjustable longitudinal slide with knurled knob\n- Ground steel pillar ensures accurate right angles to the base\n- Fine adjustment feature for precise job setting\n- Integrated 6 mm holder for secure dial gauge mounting\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **hardness:** 55-58 HRC (anvil)\n- **other:** {'anvil_surface_flatness': 'within 0.00008" (0.002 mm)', 'pillar_perpendicularity': '90° + 1/2"'}\n\n## Variants\n\n### DCS/12/RD\n\n**Dial Comparator Stand - Round Anvil**\n\n#### Specifications\n\n- **other:** {'anvil_type': 'Round', 'anvil_size': '2-3/8 inch (60 mm)', 'throat_depth': '2-3/4 inch (70 mm)', 'measuring_range': '3 inch (75 mm)', 'fine_adjustment': '5/16 inch (8 mm)'}\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Size | Weight | Box_Qty | EAN | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| DCS/12/RD | 01607 | Round Anvil 2-3/8 inch (60 mm) |  | 3 |  |  |\n\n