357	VB-S	Ultimate Vee Block & Clamp Set	Vee Block & Clamp Set	Precision_Catalogue_CA_03	44	vision_pipeline/data/Precision_Catalogue_CA_03/chunks/0061_vb_s.md	# Ultimate Vee Block & Clamp Set\n\n**Product Code:** `VB-S`\n**Category:** Vee Block & Clamp Set\n**Source Page:** 44\n\n## Description\n\nManufactured from selected steel, fully hardened and ground. Extremely versatile Vee Block Set with enhanced features.\n\n## Features\n\n- Use on base, on end and flat on either sides. Clamp is within the outside width of the block.\n- Adjustable side screw with cap in the clamp supports the block and prevents tilting during drilling, milling or grinding operations.\n- Four 3/8" - 16 tapped holes, two in the base and one on each side allow attachment to an angle iron which can then be attached to a lathe face plate or held by a magnetic chuck.\n- Groove at the stepped end, right angled to the base, provides a handy means for holding shouldered studs, round pins etc.\n\n## Variants\n\n### VB/S/48\n\n**Ultimate Vee Block & Clamp Set**\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Block_Length_Inch | Block_Length_MM | Block_Width_Inch | Block_Width_MM | Block_Height_Inch | Block_Height_MM | Clamping_Capacity_Inch | Clamping_Capacity_MM | Box_Qty |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| VB/S/48 | 02910 | 3-19/32 | 90 | 1-7/8 | 48 | 1-7/8 | 48 | 1-5/16 | 33 | 25 |\n\n---\n	{"Features": "- Use on base, on end and flat on either sides. Clamp is within the outside width of the block.\\n- Adjustable side screw with cap in the clamp supports the block and prevents tilting during drilling, milling or grinding operations.\\n- Four 3/8\\" - 16 tapped holes, two in the base and one on each side allow attachment to an angle iron which can then be attached to a lathe face plate or held by a magnetic chuck.\\n- Groove at the stepped end, right angled to the base, provides a handy means for holding shouldered studs, round pins etc.", "Variants": "### VB