361	AVB	Adjustable Vee Block Set	Adjustable Vee Block Set	Precision_Catalogue_CA_03	47	vision_pipeline/data/Precision_Catalogue_CA_03/chunks/0065_avb.md	# Adjustable Vee Block Set\n\n**Product Code:** `AVB`\n**Category:** Adjustable Vee Block Set\n**Source Page:** 47\n\n## Description\n\nVersatile, high precision tool performing variety of functions that would normally require usage of various shims, blocks or machinist's jacks.\n\n## Features\n\n- Ideal for inspecting shafts and parts with multiple diameters\n- Anvil height on the block is easily adjustable to support shafts, bars of varying diameters for quick inspection without having to use centers\n- Anvil supports upto 450 kgs (1000 lbs)\n- Vibration lock (position lock) prevents creeping\n- Wide angle Vee accepts 3/16" (5mm) to 5" (125mm) diameters\n- Top flats ground parallel to the base can hold wide and flat parts\n- Narrow flats may be held on a parallel across the top\n- Total Rise of Vee - 1/2" (12mm). Dial graduated in increments of 0.001" (25 microns)\n- Sold as a set of 2 blocks in matched pairs\n\n## Utility\n\n- Used to check concentricity of different diameters on a stepped rod\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **other:** Height Difference Between Matched Pairs: Within 0.001" (25 µ); Flatness of Base: Within 0.0002" (5 µ)\n\n## Variants\n\n### AVB/1P\n\n**Adjustable Vee Block Set**\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | BLOCK LENGTH (INCH) | BLOCK LENGTH (MM) | BLOCK WIDTH (INCH) | BLOCK WIDTH (MM) | BLOCK HEIGHT (INCH) | BLOCK HEIGHT (MM) | CLAMPING CAPACITY (INCH) | CLAMPING CAPACITY (MM) | Box_Qty |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| AVB/1P | 02930 | 7/8 | 23 | 3 | 78 | 2.6 | 67 | 0.29-2.3 | 5-125 | 10 |\n\n---\n	{"Utility": "- Used to check concentricity of different diameters on a stepped rod", "Features": "- Ideal for inspecting shafts and parts with multiple diameters\\n- Anvil height on the block is easily adjustable to support shafts, bars of vary