362	VB-BB	Ball Bearing Vee Block & Clamp Sets	Ball Bearing Vee Block & Clamp Sets	Precision_Catalogue_CA_03	48	vision_pipeline/data/Precision_Catalogue_CA_03/chunks/0066_vb_bb.md	# Ball Bearing Vee Block & Clamp Sets\n\n**Product Code:** `VB-BB`\n**Category:** Ball Bearing Vee Block & Clamp Sets\n**Source Page:** 48\n\n## Description\n\nHigh precision Vee Blocks are used to inspect & detect out of round conditions, defects and lobes without damage to both the parts being checked and the Vee Block itself. Ideal for use where inspection set-ups are not possible using regular Vee Blocks. Design allows inspection of components from two angles by turning the spacer block 90°. Vee Blocks bases are manufactured from cast iron.\n\n## Features\n\n- Fully Hardened (60 HRC) wear resistant balls with sphericity controlled within 0.000025" (0.6 µ) on the small and medium sets and 0.00005" (1.27 µ) on the large set.\n- Balls are finished to 0.2 micro inches.\n- Supplied in matched pairs, complete with two clamps and one test ball.\n- Matched pairs are controlled within ±0.0002" (±0.005mm)\n\n## Specifications\n\n- **hardness:** 60 HRC\n- **other:** Sphericity controlled within 0.000025" (0.6 µ) on small and medium sets, 0.00005" (1.27 µ) on large set; Balls finished to 0.2 micro inches; Matched pairs controlled within ±0.0002" (±0.005mm)\n\n## Variants\n\n### VB/BB/1-2\n\n**Small Pair**\n\n#### Specifications\n\n- **capacity:** Minimum 3/64 inch (1.20 mm), Maximum 2-1/2 inch (63 mm) without clamps\n- **other:** Ball diameter: 1/2 inch; Clamping capacity: 100 kgs (220 lbs)\n\n#### Ordering Information\n\n| Cat_No | Ord_No | Size | Weight | Box_Qty | EAN | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| VB/BB/1-2 | 02940 | Small Pair | None | 20 | None | None |\n\n---\n\n### VB/BB/15-16\n\n**Medium Pair**\n\n#### Specifications\n\n- **capacity:** Minimum 3/32 inch (2.38 mm), Maximum 5 inch (127 mm) without clamps\n- **other:** Ball diameter: 15/16 inch; Clamping capacity: 5